{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d735317fc074598b4036684fdd9a2a0484908f4e2028dee4d886916839bb30c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02b3550244d5aed906424d270922f46fd6e855a7aded50169a548d2fa1800f1b",
      "text": "接下来，请华村翔真先生回答！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37b39647d44428ab3c5925138798762157e3649902994a188937adc0920709a8",
      "text": "我是因为想再次追寻\n学生时代看到过的那片景象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a021e45a0036316d6b629f01bf7051b4bb2131a0f36d6b71f17d0a88e62186",
      "text": "我是为了站在舞台正中心最耀眼的地方，\n才成为歌舞伎演员的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c540abb8447162e477713a64e6775a2d4d17d5984f19ff1ca98279f73e74b25",
      "text": "……因为一些契机，让我想起了这件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ad52088debc4e8be5276962b5d5db8f650b27c230179fddd0d2201464cbe98",
      "text": "正在那时，那边的●●●●プロデューサー酱\n对我说我有成为偶像的光芒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5410794e68576ade4812aec0c79c6b30e01f564c836ec0bec27b909caa355e82",
      "text": "那句话恰到好处地，\n戳中了我的心坎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87514022b7fc5129640be3335a37ffa9b987372d177a082f2ba33b3b08e6c69a",
      "text": "还有呢，我也很中意制作人酱明明知道我是谁，\n还敢主动来搭话的气魄哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92c7bddf8036747f8b07b50f6d2ccbd407d78cc6c667e103f2954b81fc676132",
      "text": "要再次发起挑战的话，就选这家事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62cf802542cda66161a115a027266618f24f6cb330800f4f1c24080fe9eaa8d0",
      "text": "只要能实现梦想，哪怕从底层摸爬滚打做起，\n我也乐意之至！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f3001fe81913a9fbfa6378b53287d7eb83f7a164219c56fa7e79726ec7fee4d",
      "text": "（我自己也没资格说九郎酱呢，\n一口气全交代得这么坦白……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:283d0cfa45c16e8c18d740bcf9254c78a45576d9e283ee1ce5ec6d212ad1789a",
      "text": "（从底层摸爬滚打……华村先生也是带着觉悟\n想要成为偶像的呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
